## https://github.com/shshemi/tabiew?tab=readme-ov-file#useful-keybindings
Tabview: Show help with all keyboard shortcuts                               | F1
Tabview: Open sheet                                                          | Etr
Tabview: Navigation                                                          | h/j/k/l / Lt/Dn/Up/Rt
Tabview: Previous/Next column                                                | b/w
Tabview: Toggle Auto-Fit                                                     | e
Tabview: Move half/full page up/down                                         | C-u/d / C-b/f
Tabview: Move to first/last row                                              | g/G / Home/End
Tabview: Reset data frame                                                    | C-r
Tabview: Close                                                               | q
Tabview: Quit Application                                                    | Q
Tabview: Command Palette                                                     | :
Tabview: Fuzzy Search                                                        | /
Tabview: Query the data in SQL                                               | `Q/query SELECT * FROM $tab`
Tabview: Query current data frame for columns/functions                      | `S/select $col1, $col2 ...`
Tabview: Filter current data frame, keeping rows were the condition(s) match | `F/filter $data1 < 10 AND $data2 > 1`
Tabview: Sort current data frame by column(s)                                | `O/order <cols>`
Tabview: Create a new tab with the given query                               | `tabn SELECT * FORM $tab WHERE $data > 10`
Tabview: Return to table from sheet view otherwise quit                      | `q/quit`
Tabview: Show loaded data frame(s) alongside their path(s)                   | `schema`
Tabview: Reset the table to the original data frame                          | `reset`
Tabview: Show command reference in a new tab                                 | `help`